# concept Self-attention {#self_attention}

A mechanism that lets positions in a sequence weight information from other positions.

# claim Attention supports direct token interactions {#claim_direct_interactions}

Evidence: `raw/attention-is-all-you-need.md` and `{#source_vaswani_2017}`. The proposed Transformer uses attention rather than recurrence for sequence transduction. Confidence: high for the proposed architecture.

# relates wiki/transformers

Self-attention is a core Transformer component.
